  "notes": "Designators P1/P2 printed on the back-view silkscreen. Labels are the silkscreen/number boxes; the pink GPIO names render the letter O like a zero (e.g. 'GPI004'), transcribed as GPIO04 etc. USB position taken from the USB-C mounting pads at the bottom of the back view (front view also shows USB-C at the bottom). LCD-internal signals (DC GPIO11, CS GPIO10, SCK GPIO12, MISO GPIO13, TFT_BL GPIO14, RST GPIO1) and RESET/BOOT buttons are not header pins."
